Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.43,0:00:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your precious Dark Magician\Nfrom you and send you to mental oblivion!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.29,0:01:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi obviously doesn't know a\NMaster Magician's first rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Always save the best trick for the finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You should stop worrying about me\Nand take care of yourself, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.17,0:01:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my show, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.97,0:01:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.29,0:01:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you a chance to save yourself,\Nbut you've left me with no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.79,0:01:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to lose it all, Arcana!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.93,0:02:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand\Nwhat happened to Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have fallen into a trap door.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.19,0:02:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what I'm worried about is\Nwhere that trap door may have led him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.21,0:02:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just got to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.31,0:02:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and we'll check every square\Ninch of Battle City until we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will ever find us here, so\Nyou'll be alone when you lose it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.31,0:02:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to defend myself\Nfrom another direct attack
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,By Yugi's Dark Magician, or\Nit'll be curtains for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.43,0:02:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.87,0:02:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystic Tomato in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.59,0:02:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.61,0:02:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get on with the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Arcana's Mystic Tomato is a weak defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.53,0:02:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I summon another\Nmonster and destroy it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.17,0:02:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I can mount an attack on his\Nlife points and win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the bait, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you want to summon another monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you do, I'll\Nhave a surprise waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.79,0:03:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's where it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Beta, the Magnet Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.75,0:03:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You've activated my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Renewal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.33,0:03:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes a monster from each player\Nand sends them to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But in return, it brings back one monster\Nthat's been lost by the cardholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.91,0:03:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In this case, that means me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You want your dark magician back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.23,0:03:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That will give me a second\Nchance to annihilate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, my Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You have your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dark Magician versus Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out who the real master is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.05,0:04:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Our monster's points are identical,\Nso merely attacking won't be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to think more strategically.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.43,0:04:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And only a true illusionist like myself\Ncan master the power of a dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to lose your card, and your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.69,0:04:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Think again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll place these two\Ncards on the field, face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This show will have more\Ntwists than Yu-Gi expects.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.57,0:04:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll match him move for move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Two can play at that game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.57,0:04:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also place two cards face\Ndown. So what's next? I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one more card face\Ndown. Brilliant move, Yugi. So I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:05:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Place one more card face down\Nas well. I'll place my last and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.97,0:05:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,so will I we each have four cards\Nface down and one dark magician
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.81,0:05:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and now let's see who picked\Nthe best This dueling strategy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.67,0:05:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play a magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The mystical guillotine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to your Dark Magician, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As if you had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark magician, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.71,0:05:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dark magician's about\Nto be cut from the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and your mind will be\Ntrapped in the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for the grand finale!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.57,0:05:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, Arcana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.61,0:05:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but the show's over\Nand the curtain must now fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Write on your dark magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:06:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that you'll\Nhave to find him first!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.59,0:06:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Magical Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.09,0:06:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll have to guess which\Nhat he's under to attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.59,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,These magic daggers will detect\Nand destroy your dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.77,0:06:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.65,0:06:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rescue him with Curse Breaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It cancels out all other magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.57,0:06:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroying my Dark Magician\Nwon't be easy, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, attack with Dark Magic now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.41,0:06:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll destroy each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And now my Dark Magician will return!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:06:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're back to where we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.79,0:07:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a stalemate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.37,0:07:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you unlock us from these\Nshackles and finish this duel with honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.71,0:07:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,With honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And ruin all the fun? Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But answer this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you lead me down here, Arcana?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And why did you force\Nme into a duel in which
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,the loser's mind gets sent\Ninto the Shadow Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.45,0:07:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just following the\Norders of my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough secrets, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.51,0:07:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once, I was the greatest illusionist and\Nmagician since Harry Houdini himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, the Great Arcana!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.85,0:07:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My act was the envy of the entire magic\Nworld, and I loved every minute of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I had it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.29,0:07:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Money, fame, but most importantly,\NI had her, my sweet Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We were going to be married\Nuntil that fateful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a routine escape trick\NI'd done it a million times
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.19,0:08:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But as Catherine looked on\NSomething went horribly wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.53,0:08:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my career And my movie star good\Nlooks that day Then I lost Catherine's love
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.35,0:08:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I drove her away, Yugi I was a broken\Nman I didn't want her to see me ruined
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She stood by me and I heard her.\NBy the time I figured that out, it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,was too late she was gone my life
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Was over until I met him, Maric.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,he made me an offer if i could eliminate\Nyugi moto for good he'd help me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Win back Katherine with the help of his\NMillennium Rod working for Maric will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:09:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Only lead you to more pain and suffering.\NArcana Merrick cares about no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,except himself he'll say and do anything\Nto get what he wants it's a cruel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,cruel world yugi you'll find that out\Nsoon enough there are very few things
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you can count on and even fewer people\Nbut i am counting on merrick to bring
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.51,0:09:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,my catherine back into my arms there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.99,0:09:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,she is waiting for me just like merrick
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,promised he's a man of honor yugi You\Nshouldn't be so quick to judge people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.29,0:09:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a minute, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to destroy Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can be together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So you see, Yugi, it's nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fool to trust in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, you should be placing your trust\Nin yourself and in your cards, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.11,0:09:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You rely on tricks and illusions to\Nwin instead of believing in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And that will be your downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just cards,\NYu-Gi, and nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That is your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not just cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is in my deck, and that's\Nsomething you'll never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.49,0:10:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You talk about your faith in the cards,\NYu-Gi, but that will be your downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.35,0:10:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd depend on your\Ndark magician to bail you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,so I built my dueling\Ndeck with one purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.51,0:10:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,to take your dark magician away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And that dark energy disc will take\Nsomething even more precious from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.15,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi must be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.79,0:11:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi still hasn't reappeared\Non our duelist tracking screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.53,0:11:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,His duel disc won't operate unless\Nit has a connection to Kaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Corporation's tournament computer\Nor another compatible system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Mokuba,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,if Yugi is dueling someone\Nwho doesn't want me watching,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be battling in\Na secret location that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,has its own internal\Ncomputer dueling system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Search for every computer network\Nin Battle City that is compatible
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,With Kaiba Corporation's dueling\Nsystem, and make it snappy. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Isolate any systems that refuse to\Nidentify themselves to our network.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hit the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just radio me when you find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Set us free, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until I win your Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.17,0:11:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,With great pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for the Shadow Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.91,0:12:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.85,0:12:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I place two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to spice up this show. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.79,0:12:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I reveal a magic card back into the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my dark magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.65,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Yuge, you should be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,With its gruesome claw,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.13,0:12:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,this magic card snatches up any\Nopponent's monster and transports it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.09,0:12:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,directly to the graveyard so you can\Nsay goodbye to your dark magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh really? Afraid not, you didn't count on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,this mystical riff panel this trap card
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.67,0:12:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,will counter the darkness of your magic\Ncard and spare my monster but not for long
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:13:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll see we will back into the dark was\Na decoy to get you to waste your trap card
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,i knew that you would fall for that trick
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,now it's my turn to play a trap card yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.01,0:13:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,These chains will bind your Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.97,0:13:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,putting him out of play and leaving\Nyou open to a direct attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.15,0:13:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dark Magician is trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.35,0:13:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,With your monster hung up for the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.73,0:13:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,all he can do is look on helplessly\Nwhile I destroy his master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you won't be\Nhis master for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.85,0:13:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So it doesn't really matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose Soon he will\Nbelong to Merrick And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,prepare yourself It's showtime Dark\NMagician, attack Ubi's life points directly
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is turning into quite\Nthe performance And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch, my friends, as the energy disc\Nsends Yugi's mind to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.35,0:14:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One touch of that dark energy disc And\Nyour mind's banished to the Shadow Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost ready for my grand finale,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.59,0:14:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi And it's worth sticking\Naround for I don't want to ruin the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,surprise for you but let's just say\NMerrick will be extremely pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.79,0:14:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You, on the other hand, probably won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But why spoil it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time for you\Nto make your final move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.61,0:14:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't free my Dark\NMagician, Arcanus got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been over every\Nsquare inch of Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and we haven't found a\Ntrace of Yugi anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.67,0:15:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We've just got to keep looking for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.05,0:15:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Moto, it's Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, you've got to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi walked into a tent\Nand he disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.49,0:15:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We've looked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're afraid that he\Nmight have been kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.95,0:15:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba just found out where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.41,0:15:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What timing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.88,0:15:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You lead the way and we'll follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll summon my big shield\Ngardener in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.57,0:15:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to protect my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.27,0:15:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.65,0:15:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,cowering behind your monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,desperately trying to\Nput off your inevitable
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:16:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,defeat at the hands of\Nmy mighty dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.97,0:16:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that defense won't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,After my next turn, your\Nlife points will be zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if you're done with your\Nturn, it's time for my next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I will also summon a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.65,0:16:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to the Doll of Demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Yugi, behold the magic\Ncard that will annihilate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Ectoplasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Confused, Yuge?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ectoplasmer is a magic card that drains\Nthe very soul of one of my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Creating a pure concentrated form\Nof energy known as Ectoplasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.49,0:16:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,which is then fired directly at you! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.91,0:16:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you turn your own monsters into\Nhollow shells, they'll be of no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.89,0:17:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but once I've destroyed you,\NI'll have no more use for them anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.59,0:17:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my task will be complete, and I'll\Nbe reunited with my sweet Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Catherine, my darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few more minutes\NThen we're off to Hawaii
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Or Tahiti Or wherever\Nyou'd like Say goodbye,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.31,0:17:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi I'm about to drain your life points\NBy draining one of my monster's souls away
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Extract ectoplasm
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,One more hit and my life\Npoints will go down to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You played well, Yuge, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But do you know why you and your\Nbeloved dark magician couldn't beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.25,0:17:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,In battle, monsters respond best to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.39,0:18:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to make certain that they are\Nafraid of you You will never command their
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,respect with kindness and trust Just\Nlook what happened to your favorite car,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the Dark Magician
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.89,0:18:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the master,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.43,0:18:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,they are the servants And they\Nshould ensure victory for you Even
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.09,0:18:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If it means you have to destroy them\Nto get there, you're a sick man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.23,0:18:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my show.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and my Dark Magician knows that I am\Nhis master He is nothing but my pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the grand finale.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.47,0:18:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Ectoplasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Extract the soul of my dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.79,0:18:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.15,0:18:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel has already gone way too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.55,0:18:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when I'm about to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.37,0:18:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire the Ectoplasm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.69,0:19:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.03,0:19:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The soul of Yuki's Dark Magician was also
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,drained and seems to\Nbe blocking my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.01,0:19:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll both be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like your plan\Nto destroy me backfired.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so busy disrespecting\Nyour cards, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,that you failed to learn\Nhow to use them properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,While it is true that your\Nectoplasmer drains your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,monster's soul and fires\Nthat energy at your opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.27,0:19:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,what you obviously didn't\Nrealize is that when
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.89,0:19:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,there's more than one of the\Nsame monster on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.61,0:19:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,they're all affected in the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So my dark magician was\Ndrained of his soul also.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.55,0:19:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Canceling out your attack, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have avoided that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.97,0:20:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're still one attack away from\Nbeing banished to the Shadow Realm forever!
